Lunario dei Frati Patchatori — licenses
=======================================

This repository contains material under different licenses. Commercial use
is not allowed for the code and the original content; the data derived from
Vulnerability Garden stays under its ShareAlike license, which does not allow
adding that restriction.

1. Code
   Everything not listed below (scripts/, src/ except src/data/, configuration).
   PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0
   https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0
   Full text: LICENSES/PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0.md

   Required Notice: Copyright (c) 2026 Daniele Parazza (https://github.com/danieleparazza/frati-patchatori)

2. Original content
   Parody texts (src/data/saints/), holy cards (src/data/santini/ and their
   definitions in data/santini.mjs) and the share images generated from them.
   Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International
   (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/
   The holy cards and parody texts are AI-generated (Claude, Anthropic) and
   reviewed by hand.

3. Vulnerability data
   src/data/vulns.json, src/data/days.json, data/overrides.json,
   data/extra-vulns.json.
   Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0),
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
   Derived from Vulnerability Garden (https://vulnerability.garden) by
   Shellsharks, CC BY-SA 4.0. Changes: one patron selected per calendar day;
   corrected dates; CVSS, product and CISA KEV status added from the CVE List
   and the CISA KEV catalog; hand-curated rankings fields.

4. Font
   src/assets/fonts/EBGaramond.ttf: EB Garamond by The EB Garamond Project
   Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (src/assets/fonts/OFL.txt).

Official vulnerability logos, where used, remain the property of their
authors under their own licenses.

Versions of this repository published up to commit 7e8f4a6 (2026-10-24) were
released with the code under the MIT License and the content under CC BY-SA
4.0; those versions keep those licenses.
